# onboarding's routes (core/modules/onboarding/README.md "Routes"): the workspace's Company Knowledge,
# the Draft from its website, and the review of the draft. The Draft, the accept and the discard are
# @Idempotent(): each Idempotency-Key is an example UUID; another one makes a new request, the same one
# answers the first answer again for a day. Without a pending draft, the accept and the discard answer
# 409 company_knowledge_no_draft. A write sends the cookie, so it sends Origin: {{appOrigin}} too (the
# api's origin check).

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/onboarding/company-knowledge: the record, its fetch status, the pages read and the pending draft; the first read creates it empty
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/onboarding/company-knowledge
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### PUT /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/onboarding/company-knowledge: saves it; changed fields become human
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/onboarding/company-knowledge
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}

{
  "sourceUrl": "https://acme.example",
  "oneLiner": "Warehouse robots that pick and pack around the clock.",
  "longDescription": "Acme builds picking robots for mid-sized warehouses.",
  "products": ["Picking arm", "Packing cell"],
  "painPoints": ["Pickers are hard to hire for night shifts"],
  "featuresBenefits": ["Installs over a weekend"],
  "proofPoints": [
    { "text": "Picking is 40% faster at Beta Logistics", "sourceUrl": "https://acme.example/customers" },
    { "text": "Used in 120 warehouses" }
  ],
  "competitors": ["Gamma Robotics"],
  "tone": "Plain and practical, no hype."
}

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/onboarding/company-knowledge/draft: drafts from the saved website; 202, fetchStatus fetching, the pending draft dropped
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/onboarding/company-knowledge/draft
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/onboarding/company-knowledge/draft/accept: accepts the pending draft; replaceEdited also replaces what a person wrote
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/onboarding/company-knowledge/draft/accept
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000301

{ "replaceEdited": false }

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/onboarding/company-knowledge/draft/discard: discards the pending draft; the record keeps every field
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/onboarding/company-knowledge/draft/discard
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000302
